  "id": "butter-bean-curry",
  "name": "Butter Bean Curry",
  "subtitle": "A warming bean and aubergine curry with fresh banana-lime relish",
  "description": "Butter beans and aubergine simmer with tomatoes, ginger, garlic, and curry spices, then come together with wholegrain rice and a bright fresh relish.",
